# API endpoints

Contract canon: [api/openapi.yaml](../../api/openapi.yaml).

## JSON and URLs

| Layer | Rule |
| ----- | ---- |
| JSON keys | `snake_case` tags |
| Enum values | `snake_case` |
| URL paths | `kebab-case` |
| GET entities | include `created_at` if column exists (not `/health`) |

Exceptions: `token_type: "Bearer"`; single-word keys (`email`, `password`).

DTOs: [internal/auth/apitypes.go](../../internal/auth/apitypes.go) for shared auth types.

## New endpoint checklist

1. Echo route in feature handler
2. Update `api/openapi.yaml`
3. Update `postman/mentorix-backend.postman_collection.json`
4. Add/adjust `schemaBindings` in `internal/apicheck/schema.go` if new schemas
5. Update `docs/features/<feature>.md` (non-obvious rules only)

Run: `SKIP_SMOKE=1 ./postman/validate.sh` or `go test ./internal/apicheck/...`

## Docs

Do not list all paths in markdown — link OpenAPI. Feature behavior → `docs/features/`.
